1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:00,980
This skateboard

2
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:01,980
could make you FLY

3
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:03,370
across a RIVER.

4
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:04,840
You see, ten powerful

5
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:05,820
electric propellers

6
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:07,120
blast air downward,

7
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,220
lifting you completely

8
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:09,270
off the ground.

9
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:10,360
But his first version

10
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,860
used JET ENGINES…

11
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:13,270
and caught FIRE.

12
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:15,440
So he switched to electric.

13
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:16,160
Except there’s

14
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:18,040
one HUGE problem.

15
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:18,860
The board can’t

16
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:20,170
balance itself.

17
00:00:20,170 --> 00:00:21,080
He has to control it

18
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,440
with his entire BODY,

19
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:23,660
while an AI voice coach

20
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:24,220
helps him learn

21
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,320
how to balance.

22
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:26,300
And after just over

23
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,630
ten days of practice,

24
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:28,560
he actually flew

25
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:29,720
across a RIVER…

26
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,310
and THROUGH a CANYON.

27
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:32,500
How much would someone

28
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,340
have to PAY YOU

29
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:34,510
to ride this thing?

